<div id="2026-10-05-ai-editor-git-commit-fix" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-05 — AI Editor Git Commit Path Rejection Fix + Router-Orchestrated Task Handling</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Diagnosed the "Rejected unsafe or unknown path(s)" error from the Git dashboard and AI2 editor commit flow. Added missing runtime AI data patterns to .gitignore. Improved the rejection error message with target/checkout hint and refresh guidance. Created and wired <code>Comserv::Model::AI2::GitFix</code> (following the specialized brain pattern) that explicitly uses the Router to select models per sub-step (analysis via coding context + structured decision via local decision model). The brain returns staged proposals (with verification steps per view/stage) designed to feed the AI editor's review UI (verify buttons above changes for each view/stage). Integrated so that when the AI editor is assigned a task containing the error (or the user pastes it), it performs Router-driven diagnosis, proposes concrete changes, and surfaces in the per-stage verify flow instead of looping on clarification/plan.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The AI editor was not leveraging the full AI2 system resources (Router for model/agent choice per step, decision models for structured output, CodeRead, git subsystem status) to diagnose and complete assigned real problems. This error blocked commits from both the admin Git dashboard and AI editor review panels. The change enforces the rigorous process: Router chooses best models/agents for each step (parallel where feasible), gather real context, propose for verification in the existing review UI with per-stage verify buttons, user approves, then apply. Prevents future silent failures and makes the editor capable of fixing tasks like the git path hygiene / data ignore issue.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Model/AI2/GitFix.pm</code> (new brain), <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Controller/AI2.pm</code> (wiring in chat handler), <code>Comserv/.gitignore</code> and root <code>.gitignore</code> (runtime AI data patterns from the error list), <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Controller/Admin/Git.pm</code> (improved error in _validate_paths + dashboard_action), <code>root/admin/git/index.tt</code> + <code>ai2editor/git-review.js</code> / <code>file-diff.js</code> (path collection and review UI context), related AI2 models and templates for staged proposals.</p>
</div>
